      "durationTargetMin": 15,
      "scopeNote": "Authorised exercise at Merrin & Sallow Architects, a fictional company. In scope: one practice approach to the front desk in a courier's hi-vis, and six situations to handle on the reception seat. Jo's test is authorised and the costume is handed back afterwards.",
